OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian in 70s dies in
OL,4,Acollision with motorcycle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was walking near a
OL,7,Fsupermarket has died after being struck
OL,8,Fby a motorbike.
OL,10,FIt happened near a Morrisons on London
OL,11,FRoad, Hadleigh, at about 19:45 BST on
OL,12,FFriday, Essex Police said.
OL,14,FThe force said the woman died at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FThe motorcyclist, a man in his 20s, was
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,19,Fby dangerous driving and was taken to
OL,20,Fhospital to be treated for injuries.
